<title>RUSSIA: Russia's SIDANKO plans ADR, bond issues.</title>
<headline>Russia's SIDANKO plans ADR, bond issues.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian oil company SIDANKO plans to issue American Depositary Receipts (ADRs) in early 1998 and a convertible bond later this year, company Vice-President Dmitry Maslov said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;Having completed the issue of convertible bonds (by the end of the year) and having converted them into a (single company) share, our programme is to carry out a further share issue which will be aimed at foreign investors above all,&quot; Maslov said. &quot;(This) will be done most probably through issuing level one ADRs.&quot;</p>
</text>
